{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/05/6444688/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなにたくさん公演があるのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チケットが当たらないと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"報告を受けるのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"申し訳なさはあるけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても喜ばしい事です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それだけ期待されてるということ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"期待を大幅に上回って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みせる。魅せる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/05/6444688/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ザキさん怪我で急遽出られなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく残念だよ。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰よりも全ての物事頑張る子だから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ザキさんの分まで頑張るよーっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絢音ちゃんもまた一緒に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出たかったよー(´･ω･｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田から応援してくれてるはず！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りさこ米ちゃんも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後一緒に出たかったなあ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"para